name emoji
category Package
revision 59961
shortdesc Emoji support in (Lua)LaTeX
longdesc This package allows users to typeset emojis in LaTeX documents.
longdesc It requires the LuaHBTeX engine, which can be called by
longdesc lualatex since TeX Live 2020, or lualatex-dev in TeX Live 2019.
